# Scope control

- Change only files required by the spec/task.
- No new top-level folders without an ADR (backend/frontend/knowledge/mcp_server/tests are the product layout).
- No extra features, sample SaaS dashboards, or README novels.
- If the task is “add field X,” do not rebuild the design system or adjacent modules.
- One endpoint or one screen per PR unless the human expands the spec.
- No drive-by refactors, dependency upgrades, or formatting of unrelated files.
